<p>   (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>    NOTE:  Net income for 1995 include write offs of approximately $8.3 million, or $5.16 per share,  net of income taxes, because of a four year rate plan app;roved by the Maine Public Utilities Commission, $2.1 million, net of income taxes, for deferred retail fuel expenses, $4.8 million, net of income taxes, for the company's remaining investment in Seabrook and $1.4 million, net of income taxes, for wholesale plant investment.</p>
